<title>UK: Great Portland to develop new Virgin store.</title>
<headline>Great Portland to develop new Virgin store.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>British property development firm Great Portland Estates said on Monday that it would develop a new four level Virgin Megastore at King's Road, Chelsea.</p>
<p>The 18,000 square feet store would be one of the largest in the UK.</p>
<p>Virgin has agreed to take a new 25-year lease at a starting rent of 310,000 stg per annum. Trading is expected to start in this autumn.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
